    "title": "SEBI is Hiring: Credit Analyst (Principal)",
    "description": "SEBI has an exciting opening for a Credit Analyst at our Vijayawada office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout SEBI:\nSEBI is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage credit risk assessment and loan appraisal processes\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n• Process payroll and manage employee reimbursements\n• Prepare MIS reports for senior management review\n• Monitor market trends and provide investment recommendations\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in VBA\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in Financial Reporting\n• Proficiency in Tally\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in GST\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SEBI!",
